            text: "AC handles sustained load without the heat build-up that eventually kills DC motors, which is why commercial gyms use it. It starts around $3,000. For one person running an hour a day a good DC motor is entirely adequate for a decade; for two or three people running daily, AC is the clearest reason to spend more.",
          },
        },
